  "bodyHtml": "<main class=\"main\"><section  class=\"cb-text-box cb-text-box6a0e34d6a01d0 cb-text-box--type-one cb-text-box--align-left\" style=\"\"><div class=\"cb-text-box__container padding-top-md padding-bottom-md\"><div class=\"cb-text-box__text\"><h1><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"http://daltonwalsh.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/RedC_email_screenshot-700x486-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-1230 size-full\" data-src=\"http://daltonwalsh.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/RedC_email_screenshot-700x486-1.png\" alt=\"Red C HTML email\" width=\"931\" height=\"646\" data-srcset=\"/media/2021/03/RedC_email_screenshot-700x486-1.png 931w, /media/2021/03/RedC_email_screenshot-700x486-1-300x208.png 300w, /media/2021/03/RedC_email_screenshot-700x486-1-768x533.png 768w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 931px) 100vw, 931px\" / srcset=\"/media/2021/03/RedC_email_screenshot-700x486-1.png 931w, /media/2021/03/RedC_email_screenshot-700x486-1-300x208.png 300w, /media/2021/03/RedC_email_screenshot-700x486-1-768x533.png 768w\"></h1><h1>Red C HTML email</h1><p>Red C gave me the task of updating their emails so they would fall more in line with the new design of the website. This meant that I had to recode them all from the ground up, make them responsive and even include a “hamburger navigation menu” component on email clients that would support it.</p><p>The hamburger technique is achieved using <a href=\"https://css-tricks.com/the-checkbox-hack/\">checkboxes</a> and some conditional comments for Outlook and other more restricted clients. I talk more about the checkbox hacking technique <a href=\"/blog/quirky-email-things\">here</a>.</p><p>I also took the opportunity to add an animation to the email, just to make it a little more exciting for people.</p></div></div></section><section  class=\"cb-stats cb-stats6a0e34d6a0226 cb-stats--type-one\" style=\"\"><div class=\"cb-stats__container padding-top-md padding-bottom-md\"><h2 class=\"cb-stats__heading\">\nSkills used</h2><div class=\"cb-stats__stats-group\"><div class=\"cb-stats__stat\"><p class=\"cb-stats__stat--title\">Checkbox Hacking</p><div class=\"cb-stats__stat--bar\" style=\"\"><div class=\"cb-stats__stat--bar--progress\" data-value=\"84\" style=\"\"></div></div></div><div class=\"cb-stats__stat\"><p class=\"cb-stats__stat--title\">Advanced CSS</p><div class=\"cb-stats__stat--bar\" style=\"\"><div class=\"cb-stats__stat--bar--progress\" data-value=\"100\" style=\"\"></div></div></div></div></div></section></main>"
